            <ArticleTitle>Sliding hernia of the bladder presenting as suprapubic pain in a female.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>51-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of bilateral sliding hernia of the bladder in a 64-year-old woman who presented with suprapubic pain and nocturia and was diagnosed by voiding diary and cystogram.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
